    "body": "## Summary\n\n- Apply the approved exact copy to the start screen and “Что за игра?” modal for Boomer, Gen X, Millennial, Zoomer, and Alpha.\n- Keep shared controls, profile routing, modal API, markup hooks, and behavior intact.\n- Synchronize source and docs mirrors and update executable expectations.\n\n## Validation\n\n- Exact-copy/profile-switch regression: `python3 tools/test_stage7_essence_modal.py`\n- Stage 6 five-profile runtime defect tests: `python3 tools/test_stage6_step9_five_profile_runtime_defects.py`\n- `node --check` on changed JavaScript and `git diff --check`\n- Codex Browser desktop routing and modal interaction check completed.\n\nThe legacy Stage 6 runtime validator still reports two existing Zoomer battle-label mismatches outside this presentation-only scope. Mobile viewport checks at 375×667 and 320×480 were unavailable through the supported Codex Browser controls in this run. No merge or Safari acceptance is claimed.",
